    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***Please register on www.mysherryfitz.ie to bid on this property**\nSherry FitzGerald Brady O'Flaherty are delighted to introduce this splendid, large two-bedroom first floor apartment to the market. This apartment enjoys a wonderful south westerly aspect with spectacular views from the balcony overlooking the historic Maynooth Castle, grounds of St Patricks College & the Lyreen River. \nPerfectly set within the prestigious Lyreen Manor complex in the centre of the vibrant university town of Maynooth with all amenities on your doorstep and adjacent to the university complex. Extending to an impressive c.81 sqm./ 870 sq.ft, this bright contemporary apartment offers two fine double bedrooms (master ensuite) large, light filled open plan living/dining room with sun drenched private balcony off same, enjoying a wonderful vista. Fitted kitchen with wall and floor units, main bathroom and large hallway with utility and hot press and storage off same. \nThere is also a secure underground car parking space. Presented in excellent decorative order, with no onward chain, this sale represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a superb apartment in this highly acclaimed town centre complex and immediate viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.51m x 2.33m\nWith timber flooring. Utility & storage press off same.\n\nLiving Room / Dining Room - 4.59m x 6.55m\nBright, light filled, dual aspect room, open plan room with timber flooring and feature fire surround. Door to balcony and archway to;\n\nKitchen - 3.68m x 2.23m\nWith fitted wall & floor units. Integrated appliances.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.81m x 5.11m\nWith timber flooring and fitted wardrobes. Ensuite with shower enclosure, WC & WHB, fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.58m x 5.11m\nWith fitted wardrobes and timber flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.75m x 2.23m\nWith full bathroom suite. Quality wall & floor tiling.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Special Features:</li><li> Superb, secure town centre complex </li><li> Adjacent to university campus</li><li> Underground car parking space </li><li> Delightful southerly aspect </li><li> Superb views over the St Patrick's College & Maynooth Caste</li><li> Expertly managed development </li><li> Lift access</ul>"
      },
